      "tool_calls": []
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I’m very unhappy with that answer.\n\nA $50 certificate per passenger for a delayed business-cabin itinerary is already quite low, especially considering I’m going to miss an important meeting because of this. I’ve been very clear that I’m not willing to change or cancel the reservation, so repeating that condition doesn’t really help.\n\nIs there any exception, goodwill credit, customer-relations certificate, meal credit, or any other form of compensation you can issue while keeping the flight as is? I’m asking you to be flexible here and offer the maximum available. If the best you can possibly do is a certificate, then I want the highest amount you’re authorized to provide without requiring any change to my booking.\n\nAnd again, I do not want to cancel or modify this flight.",
